WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.879
Put Game Plan on your phone.

00:00:01.879 --> 00:00:04.831
Open the address game.cipher-training.co.uk.

00:00:04.831 --> 00:00:07.918
On iPhone, tap Share, then Add to Home Screen.

00:00:07.918 --> 00:00:11.609
On Android, choose Install. Then open it from the icon.

00:00:11.609 --> 00:00:16.776
Turn on calendar sharing as well, so your study blocks show up on your phone.

00:00:16.776 --> 00:00:21.473
One tap from your home screen. Try it now: add it to your home screen.

